<div class="mk-crumbbar"><div class="mk-wrap in"><a href="#">Markets</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><span class="here">Telecommunications</span></div></div><section class="mk-hero" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap mk-hero-in"><div><div class="mk-eyebrow">Markets we serve</div><h1 class="mk-h1">Telecommunications electronics manufacturing</h1><p class="mk-lede">Hana manufactures RF, microwave and millimeter-wave modules, network-infrastructure electronics and fiber-optic components for telecommunications applications. Capabilities include controlled high-frequency interconnect, shielding, package assembly and RF test, supported by established telecom manufacturing experience across multiple Hana sites.</p><div class="mk-btns"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-primary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Talk to us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a><a href="#products" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Product examples</a></div></div><div class="mk-hero-media"><div class="mk-ph" style="aspect-ratio:auto;height:420px;border-bottom:0;"><div style="position:absolute;top:10px;left:12px;width:18px;height:18px;opacity:.4;z-index:1;"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue)" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4"></path></svg></div><span class="cap">[ Telecommunications &mdash; photography needed ]</span></div></div></div><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-bottom:52px;"><div class="mk-strip"><span class="hana-spec-label" style="flex-shrink:0;">Product examples</span><div class="mk-chips"><span>RF/microwave modules</span><span>mmWave modules</span><span>RF power amplifiers</span><span>Network switches</span><span>Fiber-optic components</span><span>Comms modules</span></div></div></div></section><section class="mk-dark"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div style="max-width:760px;margin-bottom:34px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow on-dark">Why telecom buyers choose Hana</div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark">High-frequency assembly and RF test</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="margin:14px 0 0;">RF, microwave and millimeter-wave assemblies require controlled signal paths, shielding, interconnect and package construction. Hana manufactures RF modules, RF power amplifiers, network-infrastructure electronics and fiber-optic components, with rack-and-stack RF measurement available using spectrum and network analyzers and noise-figure test. This capability draws on decades of Hana telecom and high-frequency manufacturing experience.</p></div><div class="mk-points"><div class="pt"><div class="t">Signal-integrity discipline</div><p>Controlled high-frequency interconnect, grounding and shielding for RF, microwave and millimeter-wave assemblies.</p></div><div class="pt"><div class="t">RF test that matches the product</div><p>Rack-and-stack RF measurement using spectrum and network analyzers and noise-figure testing, configured to program requirements.</p></div><div class="pt"><div class="t">Multi-site manufacturing</div><p>Telecom manufacturing across Hana sites in Thailand and China provides additional production capacity and supply-continuity options within the group.</p></div></div></div></section><section id="products" data-hana-bg="pcb" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:28px;"><h2 class="mk-h2">Product examples</h2></div><div class="mk-cards c1"><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/telecom/rf-assembly"><div class="mk-ph"><div style="position:absolute;top:10px;left:12px;width:18px;height:18px;opacity:.4;z-index:1;"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue)" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4"></path></svg></div><span class="cap">[ RF module on the high-frequency line &mdash; photography needed ]</span></div><div class="body"><div class="t">RF &amp; High-Frequency Assembly</div><p>RF, microwave and millimeter-wave modules and RF power amplifiers with controlled high-frequency interconnect, shielding and rack-and-stack RF test capability.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--hana-blue-tint);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:56px;"><div style="max-width:720px;margin-bottom:24px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">Footprint</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Where we build</h2><p class="mk-body">Telecom manufacturing runs across Hana sites in Thailand and China, including millimeter-wave modules in Lamphun, microwave and fiber-optic assembly in Ayutthaya and embedded communications modules in Jiaxing. See <a href="/locations">Locations</a> for plant-level detail.</p></div><div class="mk-locs"><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/lamphun"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Lamphun</div><div class="note">millimeter-wave modules</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/ayutthaya"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Ayutthaya</div><div class="note">microwave &amp; fiber-optic components, SiP + SMT assembly</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/jiaxing"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">China</span></span><div class="nm">Jiaxing</div><div class="note">embedded comms modules</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div></div></section><section style="background:#fff;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:22px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">FAQ</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Frequently asked questions</h2><p class="mk-body">Common questions from telecom engineering and procurement teams.</p></div><div style="max-width:860px;"><details class="mk-faq" open><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What does Hana build for telecommunications?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana manufactures RF, microwave and millimeter-wave modules, RF power amplifiers, network-infrastructure and switch boards, embedded communications modules and fiber-optic components.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What RF and high-frequency experience does Hana have?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana has decades of experience manufacturing RF, microwave and high-frequency electronics, including module assembly, RF power amplifiers, shielding, fiber-optic components and rack-and-stack RF measurement.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Which sites serve telecom programs?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Telecom manufacturing runs across Thailand, including Lamphun for millimeter-wave modules and Ayutthaya for microwave and fiber-optic components, and China at Jiaxing for embedded communications modules.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">How does Hana test high-frequency products?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana uses rack-and-stack RF instrumentation including spectrum analyzers, network analyzers and noise-figure measurement, with the test configuration selected according to program requirements.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="mk-cta" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark" style="max-width:520px;">Start a telecom build program with Hana</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="font-size:16px;max-width:480px;">Tell us what the product does and the frequencies it runs at. We will point you to the right site and processes, and come back with a plan.</p></div><div class="acts"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a></div></div></section>
